## Technology Stack

Storefront Next baseline — common to all projects on this accelerator:

| Category            | Technology                                        |
| ------------------- | ------------------------------------------------- |
| Frontend            | React 19 + React Router 7 (framework mode) + RSC + TypeScript |
| Build / dev         | Vite                                              |
| Hosting             | Salesforce Managed Runtime (MRT)                  |
| Commerce backend    | Salesforce B2C Commerce Cloud (SFCC)              |
| Commerce APIs       | SCAPI, server-side via `createApiClients()` (loaders/actions) + `useScapiFetcher` |
| CMS                 | Page Designer (via decorators)                    |
| Custom endpoints    | Custom SCAPI cartridges (Page-Designer / Custom-API only — no Rhino storefront scripting) |
| Styling             | Tailwind CSS 4                                    |
| Testing             | Playwright (E2E), Vitest (unit)                   |

## Environments

Project-specific instances, MRT preview URLs, and local dev server. **Data only** — for the mechanics
(b2c CLI auth, `dw.json` resolution, OCAPI/SCAPI tokens, MRT deploy) use the `b2c-config`,
