### SFCC instances

Credentials live in `sfcc/dw.json` (gitignored); run `b2c` commands from `sfcc/`. Instances usually
share credentials — only the hostname differs.

| Environment | Hostname | Org ID | MRT Preview URL |
|---|---|---|---|
| dev (sandbox) | `<sandbox>.dx.commercecloud.salesforce.com` | `f_ecom_<org>` | n/a (sandbox) |
| development | `<development-host>` | `f_ecom_<org>_dev` | `<mrt-preview-development-url>` |
| staging | `<staging-host>` | `f_ecom_<org>_stg` | `<mrt-preview-staging-url>` |

### Local dev server

- Start `pnpm dev` (Vite, default `http://localhost:5173`) — see `sfnext-project-setup`.
- Site prefix: `{{SFCC_SITE_PREFIX}}` — storefront URLs look like `{{SFCC_SITE_PREFIX}}/login`.
- Basic Auth (MRT preview / protected dev environments): username + password from the project's `.env`
  — never hard-code. Playwright browser-auth caveat is documented in `verification-standards`.

